      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense burden of guilt and grief right now. The silence of the dying fire might be mirroring the quiet that has fallen after such a devastating loss. Try to hold onto the fact that these events are tied to the pressures of the moment, which is often far more complex than simple choice. Allow yourself the space to feel the weight of what happened without letting it completely define who you are.",
